; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.154.dadx#network-area-info-list-element)
; AVP: Network-Area-Info-List
; Section: 5.3.2
; Page: 11
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.0.0
"The Network-Area-Info-List AVP (AVP code 4201) is of type OctetString, it contains the network area information which is coded as specified in 3GPP TS 29.274 [6] in Presence Reporting Area Action IE, starting from octet 9."
    encoding element TS29.274 8.108 "Presence Reporting Area Action"


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.154.dadx#reference-id-unique)
; AVP: Reference-Id
; Section: 5.3.3
; Page: 11
; Versions: 18.0.0..19.0.0
"It is assigned by the PCRF and shall be globally unique per PLMN."
    text-only


